## Verdict

- Novel peptides (1% class FDR): model **461** vs null **374** across 12 populations.
- PC-churn: canonical PSMs 3,284,622 (baseline) -> 3,256,321 (model, -28,301) -> 3,221,135 (null, -63,487). The null DB displaces 35,186 MORE canonical PSMs than the model DB.
- Net PSM: model 3,259,869 vs null 3,232,585.

